OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to pedestrianise Edinburgh's
OL,4,AGeorge Street approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to pedestrianise a major city
OL,7,Fcentre road in Edinburgh have been
OL,8,Fpassed by councillors after a "long and
OL,9,Fpainful debate".
OL,11,FGeorge Street will close to vehicular
OL,12,Ftraffic and be replaced with a
OL,13,Ftree-lined boulevard with space for
OL,14,Fwalking and cycling.
OL,16,FThe refurbishment, estimated to cost
OL,17,Fabout #20m, will allow buses to access
OL,18,Fthe street in the event of a "major
OL,19,Fincident" blocking other routes between
OL,20,Fthe east and west of the city.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
