OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to pedestrianise Edinburgh's
OL,4,AGeorge Street approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity of Edinburgh Council's transport
OL,7,Fconvener, Stephen Jenkinson, told a
OL,8,Fmeeting of the transport and
OL,9,Fenvironment committee the decision
OL,10,Fwould provide "clarity" for local
OL,11,Fbusinesses.
